{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-18761","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17393","text":"Dual- and Triple-Loop Machine Architecture"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17394","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE update (OS-010, 2026-04):"},{"id":"spn-17395","text":" With the introduction of OS-010 PULSE, the loop-interlock pattern documented here is now formalized as a manifest standard. Graphonomous, PRISM, AgenTroMatic, and every other portfolio loop declare their phases in "},{"id":"spn-17396","marks":["code"],"text":"<loop>.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-17397","text":" files (see "},{"id":"spn-17398","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/manifests/"},{"id":"spn-17399","text":"), validated against "},{"id":"spn-17400","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-17401","text":". The \"dual loop\" is a special case of arbitrarily nestable PULSE loops — the same machine grouping works at any depth, and PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-17402","marks":["code"],"text":"interact"},{"id":"spn-17403","text":" phase reads the inner system's PULSE manifest to discover the "},{"id":"spn-17404","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-17405","text":" boundary at runtime rather than hard-coding the integration. See \"Triple loop and beyond\" below."}]}],"id":"blk-18762","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-18764","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17406","text":"The Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-18765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17407","text":"Graphonomous exposes 29 MCP tools. PRISM specifies 47. When both run in the same session (the benchmarking use case), the client sees 76 tools. Research shows:"}]},{"id":"blk-18766","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18768","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17408","text":"Tool selection accuracy degrades past ~30 tools (Opus 4: 49% correct at that scale)"}]}],"id":"blk-18767","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18770","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17409","text":"Each tool definition consumes 500–2,000 tokens of context before conversation starts"}]}],"id":"blk-18769","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-18772","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17410","text":"76 tools can burn 40–80K tokens just on schema overhead"}]}],"id":"blk-18771","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-18773","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17411","text":"The Insight: Machine Around the Loop, Not the Category"}]},{"id":"blk-18774","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17412","text":"Instead of grouping tools by what they "},{"id":"spn-17413","marks":["italic"],"text":"touch"},{"id":"spn-17414","text":" (graph write, graph read, belief, etc.), group them by "},{"id":"spn-17415","marks":["bold"],"text":"which phase of the closed loop the agent is in"},{"id":"spn-17416","text":" when it calls them."}]},{"id":"blk-18775","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17417","text":"Both Graphonomous and PRISM are closed-loop systems. Their loops are structurally parallel and interlock when PRISM evaluates Graphonomous:"}]},{"id":"blk-18776","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Graphonomous (memory loop)          PRISM (evaluation loop)\n──────────────────────────          ───────────────────────\nretrieve  \"What do I know?\"         compose    \"What should I test?\"\nroute     \"What should I do?\"       interact   \"Run the test\"\nact       \"Do it\"                   observe    \"Judge the result\"\nlearn     \"Did it work?\"            reflect    \"What should change?\"\nconsolidate \"Clean up\"              diagnose   \"What's actionable?\""},{"id":"blk-18777","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17418","text":"Graphonomous: 29 tools → 5 machines"}]},{"id":"blk-18778","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17419","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-17420","text":" — \"What do I know?\""}]},{"id":"blk-18779","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17421","text":"The agent calls this when it needs context before reasoning or acting."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-18781","spans":[{"id":"spn-17422","text":"Action"}]},{"id":"blk-18782","spans":[{"id":"spn-17423","text":"Replaces"}]},{"id":"blk-18783","spans":[{"id":"spn-17424","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-18780","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-18784","spans":[{"id":"spn-17425","marks":["code"],"text":"context"}]},{"id":"blk-18785","spans":[{"id":"spn-17426","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_context"}]},{"id":"blk-18786","spans":[{"id":"spn-17427","text":"κ-aware ranked retrieval with topology annotations"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18787","spans":[{"id":"spn-17428","marks":["code"],"text":"episodic"}]},{"id":"blk-18788","spans":[{"id":"spn-17429","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_episodic"}]},{"id":"blk-18789","spans":[{"id":"spn-17430","text":"Time-range filtered episodic nodes"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18790","spans":[{"id":"spn-17431","marks":["code"],"text":"procedural"}]},{"id":"blk-18791","spans":[{"id":"spn-17432","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_procedural"}]},{"id":"blk-18792","spans":[{"id":"spn-17433","text":"Semantic search scoped to procedural nodes"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18793","spans":[{"id":"spn-17434","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage"}]},{"id":"blk-18794","spans":[{"id":"spn-17435","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage_query"}]},{"id":"blk-18795","spans":[{"id":"spn-17436","text":"Standalone epistemic coverage (act/learn/escalate)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18796","spans":[{"id":"spn-17437","marks":["code"],"text":"trace_evidence"}]},{"id":"blk-18797","spans":[{"id":"spn-17438","marks":["code"],"text":"trace_evidence_path"}]},{"id":"blk-18798","spans":[{"id":"spn-17439","text":"Weighted Dijkstra evidence path between nodes"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18799","spans":[{"id":"spn-17440","marks":["code"],"text":"frontier"}]},{"id":"blk-18800","spans":[{"id":"spn-17441","marks":["code"],"text":"epistemic_frontier"}]},{"id":"blk-18801","spans":[{"id":"spn-17442","text":"Wilson interval uncertainty analysis"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-18802","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17443","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-17444","text":" — \"What should I do?\""}]},{"id":"blk-18803","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17445","text":"The agent calls this to decide whether to act, learn, deliberate, or escalate."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-18805","spans":[{"id":"spn-17446","text":"Action"}]},{"id":"blk-18806","spans":[{"id":"spn-17447","text":"Replaces"}]},{"id":"blk-18807","spans":[{"id":"spn-17448","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-18804","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-18808","spans":[{"id":"spn-17449","marks":["code"],"text":"topology"}]},{"id":"blk-18809","spans":[{"id":"spn-17450","marks":["code"],"text":"topology_analyze"}]},{"id":"blk-18810","spans":[{"id":"spn-17451","text":"SCC/κ analysis with routing recommendation"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18811","spans":[{"id":"spn-17452","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-18812","spans":[{"id":"spn-17453","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-18813","spans":[{"id":"spn-17454","text":"κ-driven deliberation over cyclic regions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18814","spans":[{"id":"spn-17455","marks":["code"],"text":"attention_survey"}]},{"id":"blk-18815","spans":[{"id":"spn-17456","marks":["code"],"text":"attention_survey"}]},{"id":"blk-18816","spans":[{"id":"spn-17457","text":"Priority survey across active goals"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18817","spans":[{"id":"spn-17458","marks":["code"],"text":"attention_cycle"}]},{"id":"blk-18818","spans":[{"id":"spn-17459","marks":["code"],"text":"attention_run_cycle"}]},{"id":"blk-18819","spans":[{"id":"spn-17460","text":"Full triage → dispatch attention cycle"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18820","spans":[{"id":"spn-17461","marks":["code"],"text":"review_goal"}]},{"id":"blk-18821","spans":[{"id":"spn-17462","marks":["code"],"text":"review_goal"}]},{"id":"blk-18822","spans":[{"id":"spn-17463","text":"Coverage-driven act/learn/escalate gate"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-18823","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-17464","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-17465","text":" — \"Do it\""}]},{"id":"blk-18824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-17466","text":"The agent calls this to mutate the knowledge graph."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-18826","spans":[{"id":"spn-17467","text":"Action"}]},{"id":"blk-18827","spans":[{"id":"spn-17468","text":"Replaces"}]},{"id":"blk-18828","spans":[{"id":"spn-17469","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-18825","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-18829","spans":[{"id":"spn-17470","marks":["code"],"text":"store_node"}]},{"id":"blk-18830","spans":[{"id":"spn-17471","marks":["code"],"text":"store_node"}]},{"id":"blk-18831","spans":[{"id":"spn-17472","text":"Store a knowledge node"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18832","spans":[{"id":"spn-17473","marks":["code"],"text":"store_edge"}]},{"id":"blk-18833","spans":[{"id":"spn-17474","marks":["code"],"text":"store_edge"}]},{"id":"blk-18834","spans":[{"id":"spn-17475","text":"Store a relationship edge"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18835","spans":[{"id":"spn-17476","marks":["code"],"text":"delete_node"}]},{"id":"blk-18836","spans":[{"id":"spn-17477","marks":["code"],"text":"delete_node"}]},{"id":"blk-18837","spans":[{"id":"spn-17478","text":"Remove a node"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18838","spans":[{"id":"spn-17479","marks":["code"],"text":"manage_edge"}]},{"id":"blk-18839","spans":[{"id":"spn-17480","marks":["code"],"text":"manage_edge"}]},{"id":"blk-18840","spans":[{"id":"spn-17481","text":"CRUD on edges"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18841","spans":[{"id":"spn-17482","marks":["code"],"text":"manage_goal"}]},{"id":"blk-18842","spans":[{"id":"spn-17483","marks":["code"],"text":"manage_goal"}]},{"id":"blk-18843","spans":[{"id":"spn-17484","text":"Goal CRUD + lifecycle transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-18844","spans":[{"id":"spn-17485","marks":["code"],"text":"belief_revise"}]},{"id":"blk-18845","spans":[{"id":"spn-17486","marks":["code"],"text":"belief_revise"}]},{"id":"blk-18846","spans":[{"id":"spn-17487","text":"Expand/contract/replace beliefs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-1884